                    "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                    "text": "@RepGLatimer Wouldn\u2019t it be cheaper just to give veterans free healthcare insurance and they could go to any hospital they want? Why are we paying for bloated VA hospitals and all the bureaucracy that goes with it?",
